  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">During 2025, the respondent was engaged in the transportation of natural gas for major producers, municipalities, local distribution companies, cogeneration and natural gas marketers through a natural gas transmission system which extends from southwest Wyoming, through the states of Utah and Nevada, to points of termination in Kern County near Bakersfield, California.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
