        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Reported depreciation expense of $ 10,293,185 on Respondent's Apex Expansion reflects depreciation accrued on total depreciable plant in service of $ 338,498,270 recorded to Account 101 Plant in service and Account 106 Construction work in progress not classified of $326,901,390,and $ 1,526,712 respectively. In addition to accumulated depreciation, the Respondent has recorded intangible plant of $10,070,168 and total accumulated depreciation of $ 121,324,261 for Respondent's Apex Expansion.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
