        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Reported depreciation expense of $ 20,612,208 on Respondent's Original System and 2002 Expansion reflects depreciation accrued on total depreciable plant in service of $1,305,782,914 recorded to Account 101 Plant in service and Account 106 Construction work in progress not classified of $1,201,773,118 and $53,887,013 respectively. In addition to accumulated depreciation, the Respondent has recorded intangible plant of $50,122,784 and total accumulated depreciation of $809,892,865 for Respondent's Original System and 2002</span>
